        "title": "Add predictive pace warnings",
        "body": "## Summary\n- add a default-off Predictive pace warnings toggle in Notifications\n- warn for Codex and Claude session/weekly windows when existing pace projections show quota may run out before reset\n- keep warning episodes scoped in memory by provider, account, window, and reset identity, re-arming only after healthy observations\n- localize the predictive pace warning preference and notification copy across app catalogs, preserving provider-first notification titles\n- use Claude OAuth owner evidence as a non-rendered discriminator for normal and selected-account no-email OAuth snapshots without exposing account data\n\nCloses #1299\n\n## Runtime proof\nRedacted local app run from commit `a8c8e98` before follow-up commits `d4048c2` (localization), `5023a79` (Claude OAuth no-email identity), and `f34ca8a` (selected Claude OAuth account identity), July 7 2026:\n- fresh CodexBar app bundle launched with `CODEXBAR_CONFIG` enabling only Codex and `CODEX_CLI_PATH` pointing at a local Codex app-server fixture\n- `predictivePaceWarningNotificationsEnabled=true`, `hidePersonalInfo=true`, `debugDisableKeychainAccess=true`, `quotaWarningSoundEnabled=true`, and `quotaWarningOnScreenAlertEnabled=true`\n- normal app preferences were backed up/restored around the run; no real account, token, cookie, or keychain data was used\n\n```text\n2026-07-07 13:17:57.227 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:app] CodexBar starting (build=101 built=2026-07-07T03:13:41Z git=a8c8e98 version=0.41.1)\n2026-07-07 13:17:57.400 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:providers] Provider enablement at startup (enabled=codex ... codex=1 ... claude=0 ...)\n2026-07-07 13:17:57.400 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:providers] Provider mode snapshot (... codexCookieSource=off codexUsageSource=cli ... openAIWebAccess=0 ...)\n2026-07-07 13:17:57.875 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:sessionQuotaNotifications] enqueuing (prefix=predictive-pace-warning-codex-session)\n2026-07-07 13:17:58.017 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:sessionQuotaNotifications] Presenting quota warning overlay\n2026-07-07 13:17:58.018 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:sessionQuotaNotifications] enqueuing (prefix=predictive-pace-warning-codex-weekly)\n2026-07-07 13:17:58.022 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:sessionQuotaNotifications] Presenting quota warning overlay\n2026-07-07 13:17:58.027 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:notifications] posting (prefix=predictive-pace-warning-codex-session)\n2026-07-07 13:17:58.027 I CodexBar[...] [com.steipete.codexbar:notifications] posting (prefix=predictive-pace-warning-codex-weekly)\n```\n\n## Validation\n- `swift test --filter PredictivePaceWarningTests` (11/11)\n- `node Scripts/check-app-locales.mjs --test && node Scripts/check-app-locales.mjs`\n- `make check`\n- `make test` (blocked by local managed-account state in `TokenAccountEnvironmentPrecedenceTests/codex CLI ignores relative profile homes`; the same failure reproduces on `origin/main` at `46edb38`)",
